TaxComposer is the default filing-service integration. Its hosted backend,
credentials, XML construction and transmission implementation are not included
in this repository and are not licensed by this distribution.

The contract snapshots describe the client-facing TaxComposer form-input API.
They contain field definitions, not IRS XSD packages or TaxComposer server code.
The sample inputs are fictional and must not be submitted as real returns.

